@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Kernel Artifact Loading
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Kernel Ref Intake" as Refs
rectangle "Vapor.lock Check" as Lock
rectangle "Toolchain Envelope Check" as Toolchain
rectangle "Platform Library Loading" as Library
rectangle "Rust-Native Registration" as Register
rectangle "Rust Surface Registration" as Surfaces
rectangle "Fail-Fast Exit" as Fail

Refs --> Lock : supplies expected kernels to
Lock --> Toolchain : supplies compatibility proof to
Toolchain --> Library : admits envelope match to
Library --> Register : calls Rust-native entrypoint for
Register --> Surfaces : installs surfaces through
Lock --> Fail : routes fingerprint mismatch to
Toolchain --> Fail : routes incompatible envelope to
Register --> Fail : routes missing Rust-native entrypoint to
@enduml
